DDSD Launcher for Linux

1. Extract this folder anywhere, then run ./ddsd-launcher
2. Press Install. The game goes in ~/.local/share/DDSD (set DDSD_HOME to change that).
3. The launcher looks for your own DDLC copy (Steam, Downloads, Documents). If it cannot find it, press
   "Find my DDLC copy" and pick the DDLC zip or any file in the DDLC folder.

Needs WebKitGTK 4.1 (package libwebkit2gtk-4.1 on Debian/Ubuntu, webkit2gtk-4.1 on Arch and Fedora).
To add it to your menu, copy ddsd-launcher.desktop to ~/.local/share/applications/ and set Exec and Icon to full paths.
